+## [0.3.2] - unreleased
+
+### Fixed
+- A call to the session that never answered (its working directory, project root or context use) held the update for good, and a Write, Edit, NotebookEdit or Bash call never ran; the README said each session call gives up after 2 seconds. Each one now does: a writing call starts at most 2 seconds late, and an update asks the session at most eight things, each for at most 2 seconds (skills-oz54).
+
 ## [0.3.1] - unreleased
 
 ### Fixed
